# =====================================================================
# 🛡️ ZERO-LEAK SOVEREIGN GITIGNORE — GHOSTBYTE SECURITY PROTOCOL
# =====================================================================
# Enforces strict zero-leak policies preventing all secret keys, private
# credentials, environment files, runtime databases, and throwaway mailboxes
# from ever being tracked or committed to public Git repositories.
# =====================================================================

